tly up 1 bp at 99.645, seeing 3-month dollar Libor at 0.355% before Mar. 14 contract expiration. That's down from 0.40% implied rate last Fri. Cash Libor has been unchanged at 0.30313% for the past 5 business days. (howard.packowitz@dowjones.com) [ 01-13-11 1302ET ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 4022   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020110113e71d000dl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
