g by Leslie Adler)\par \par \uc2 PERU-ECONOMY/GDP (PREVIEW)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|D|M|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110113e71d001jd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
