\par\par \b \uc2 PREVIEW-Peru  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  seen holding rates at 3 pct\b0\par\par\uc2 269 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Januar 2011\par 22:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 WHAT: Peru's interest rate decision\par \par \uc2 WHEN: Thursday, Jan. 6, around 6 p.m. EST (2300 GMT)\par \par \uc2 OUTCOME: No change in rate seen\par \par \uc2 REUTERS FORECAST: Peru's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to hold its benchmark interest rate <PECPI=ECI> steady at 3 percent on Thursday for the fourth straight month, according to eight of 10 economists surveyed by Reuters.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  unexpectedly held rates steady in October after five straight increases.\par \par \uc2 Peru is one of the world's fastest-growing economies, expected to have expanded 9 percent in 2010 on solid internal demand and ample foreign investment.\par \par \uc2 But inflation is still benign, ending the year at 2.08 percent, inside the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's target range of 1 percent to 3 percent.\par \par \uc2 Consumer prices rose 0.18 percent in December, after adding just 0.01 percent in November.\par \par \uc2 MARKET IMPACT: Limited as a flood of foreign capital into Peru has pushed the sol <PEN=PE> to a two-year high of about 2.80 per dollar. Some observers have said higher local rates could make the sol even more attractive at a time of very low yields in the United States.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has repeatedly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to soak up excess liquidity, buying billions of dollars to temper volatility, which could lead to inflation if the sol were to suddenly reverse direction after excessive strengthening. (Reporting by Ursula Scollo; writing by Caroline Stauffer; Editing by Leslie Adler)\par \par \uc2 PERU-ECONOMY/RATES (PREVIEW)|LANGEN|ABN|D|E|RBN|M|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110104e71400158\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
