\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: Peru's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Buys Record $493.5M In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Market\b0\par\par\uc2 222 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juli 2010\par 21:51\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds analyst comment and background starting in the third paragraph.)\par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to buy $493.5 million, a record single-day purchase by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been purchasing dollars regularly since June 18, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to lean against the wind of PEN [sol] appreciation," \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2 ' senior economist Alberto Ramos said in a note.\par \par \uc2 "The PEN is under pressure to appreciate on the back of solid capital inflows (including foreign direct investment) attracted by the constructive macro story and the prospect of higher domestic rates as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to normalize monetary conditions," he added.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday the sol ended slightly weaker at PEN2.823 per dollar. It closed the previous day at PEN2.816.\par \par \uc2 So far this year the sol has appreciated 2.22% against the U.S. dollar, while in the last 12-month period the sol has appreciated 6.65% against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  forecasts that Peru's gross domestic product will expand by 6.6% this year.\par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-99927-7269; peru@dowjones.com [ 14-07-10 1951GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100714e67e001dq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
