\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Higher; Sol Weakens\b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juli 2010\par 23:03\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock market indexes ended slightly higher Wednesday as a number of smaller companies gained ground.\par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange's broad General index closed up 0.08% at 14,067.84.\par \par \uc2 The Selective blue-chip index ended higher by 0.02% at 21,019.04.\par \par \uc2 Precious metal miners \uc2 Minera IRL Ltd\uc2 . (MIRL.LN) gained 3.7% to end at $0.85.\par \par \uc2 Beverage producer Union de Cervecerias Peruanas Backus & Johnston SA (BACKUSI.VL) increased 0.2% to end at 4.12 soles ($1.45).\par \par \uc2 Energy company \uc2 Maple Energy PLC\uc2  (MPLE.LN) gained 1.5% to end at $0.66.\par \par \uc2 The stock exchange said that there had been 787 transactions worth $15.7 million in the trading session.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to buy $493.5 million, a record single-day purchase by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been purchasing dollars regularly since June 18, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, the sol ended slightly weaker at PEN2.823 per dollar. It closed the previous day at PEN2.816.\par \par \uc2 So far this year, the sol has appreciated 2.22% against the U.S. dollar, while in the last 12-month period the sol has appreciated 6.65% against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511 - 99927 7269; peru@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -0- \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 0