foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was closed.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market. On Thursday the sol ended unchanged at 2.826 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 -By Sophie Kevany, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-198-903-8043; sophie.kevany@dowjones.com [ 07-01-10 1648ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837 5077   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020100701e671000f7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
