ccount, thus positive for the PEN," \uc2 BNP Paribas\uc2  said in a report.\par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511 - 99927 7269; peru@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -0- \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 06-23-10 1626ET ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 1071 1837 5077   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020100623e66n000dv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
