 the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  made net purchases of $13.17 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Scotiabank said in a report that it expects the sol to end the year at PEN2.75 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511 - 99927 7269; peru@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 -0- [ 03-08-10 1641ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837 5077   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020100308e638000xn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
