\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Lower; Sol Strengthens\b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Januar 2010\par 22:46\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock market indexes ended lower Wednesday as a number of blue-chip shares, especially in the mining sector, fell sharply.\par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange's broad General index ended 0.93% weaker at 15,054.02.\par \par \uc2 The Selective blue-chip index ended 1.44% lower at 24,000.36.\par \par \uc2 The mining subindex fell 1.75%\par \par \uc2 Southern Copper Corp\uc2 . (PCU) ended 2.25% weaker at $32.55 as copper prices fell.\par \par \uc2 Precious-metals mining company \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura SA\uc2  (BVN) finished 3.77% weaker at $34.50.\par \par \uc2 Financial holding company \uc2 Credicorp Ltd\uc2 . (BAP) eased 2.18% to end at $74.00. It owns Peru's largest bank, Banco de Credito.\par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to buy $108 million.\par \par \uc2 That followed \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase $13 million Monday and $285.5 million Tuesday, and large-scale purchases each day last week.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market.\par \par \uc2 With Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the sol ended slightly stronger at PEN2.854 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at PEN2.855 to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 So far this year the sol has appreciated 1.14% against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 Central Reserve Bank of Peru President Julio Velarde told reporters this week that private pension funds in Peru sold more than $500 million in first few days of this year. Other groups in the market have followed suit, placing appreciation pressure on the sol.\par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511 - 99927 7269; peru@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 -0- [ 01-20-10 1646ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837 5077   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020100120e61k000ee\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
