\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Stock Indexes Slightly Lower, Sol A Bit Weaker\b0\par\par\uc2 267 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Januar 2010\par 22:39\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock market indexes fell slightly Tuesday, in line with lower base metals prices.\par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange's broad General index fell 0.20% to close at 15194.76.\par \par \uc2 The Selective blue-chip index was down 0.39%, closing at 24349.84. The mining subindex fell 0.26%.\par \par \uc2 Zinc-lead miner \uc2 Compania Minera Atacocha SA\uc2  (ATACOBC1) fell 1.57% to close at 1.88 soles ($0.67) as both zinc and lead prices dipped.\par \par \uc2 Base metals miner \uc2 Compania Minera Milpo\uc2  SAA (MILPOC1.VL) also fell 0.13% to close at PEN7.67.\par \par \uc2 Going the other way in heavy trade, zinc silver miner Compania Minera Volcan SAA (VOLCAAC1.VL) rose 1.08% to close at PEN3.76, on the back of higher silver prices.\par \par \uc2 Precious-metals miner \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura SA\uc2  (BVN, BUENAVC1.VL) rose 2.40% in line with better gold prices to close at $35.85.\par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to buy $285.5 million.\par \par \uc2 That followed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase $13 million Monday and large-scale purchases each day last week.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market.\par \par \uc2 With the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the sol ended slightly weaker at PEN2.855 to the dollar Tuesday compared with PEN2.851 the previous session.\par \par \uc2 So far this year, the sol has appreciated 1.11% against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 - By Sophie Kevany, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-198-903-8043; sophie.kevany@dowjones.com [ 01-19-10 1639ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837 5077   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020100119e61j000ey\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
