\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Lower, Sol Unchanged\b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Januar 2010\par 22:55\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock market indexes ended lower Thursday, as a number of mining and energy shares declined on profit-taking.\par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange's broad General index ended down 1.90% to close at 15,244.26.\par \par \uc2 The Selective blue-chip index ended down 2.01% to close at 24,399.51. The mining subindex fell 0.95%.\par \par \uc2 Zinc silver mining company Compania Minera Volcan SAA (VOLCABC1.VL) fell 2.96% in heavy trade to close at 3.60 soles ($1.28).\par \par \uc2 Steel products company \uc2 Empresa Siderurgica del Peru\uc2  (SIDERC1.VL) also fell, by 4.29%, to close at PEN1.34, while energy company Maple Energy (MPLE.LN) declined 8.00% to close at $1.15.\par \par \uc2 Asked if new capital gains taxes, in effect since Jan. 1, might also be taking a toll, analysts said no.\par \par \uc2 In the case of private investors who face taxes of 5% on earnings, the current overall potential for gains probably outweighs tax concerns, they said.\par \par \uc2 For institutional investors, who must pay up to 30%, analysts said it was likely many had avoided the taxes by moving investments into private holdings or offshore.\par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to buy $28 million. That followed \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase a total of about $800 million over the previous four trading sessions.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market. With the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the sol Thursday ended unchanged at PEN2.849 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 So far this year the sol has appreciated 1.32% against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 -By Sophie Kevany, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-198-903-8043; sophie.kevany@dowjones.com [ 01-14-10 1655ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837 5077   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020100114e61e000f2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
