\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Higher, Sol Strengthens A Bit\b0\par\par\uc2 317 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 November 2009\par 22:42\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock market indexes ended higher Monday, as international prices for precious and base metals rose, lifting mining company shares.\par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange's broad General index rose 0.04% to close at 14,563.30.\par \par \uc2 The Selective blue-chip index was up 0.23% to close at 23,559.96.\par \par \uc2 The mining subindex rose 0.45%.\par \par \uc2 Copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde (CVERDEC1.VL) rose 1.79% to close at $25.04, in line with higher copper prices. Base-metals miner \uc2 Southern Copper Corp\uc2 . (PCU) also rose by 0.89% to close at $35.00.\par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  (BUENAVC1) rose 2.83% to close at PEN118.00 as gold increased.\par \par \uc2 Zinc-lead miner \uc2 Compania Minera Atacocha SA\uc2  (ATACOC1.VL) rose 0.70% to close at 1.43 soles ($0.49).\par \par \uc2 Financial holding company \uc2 Credicorp Ltd\uc2 . (BAP) was also up, by 0.95%, to close at $73.80. Credicorp owns Banco de Credito, Peru's biggest bank.\par \par \uc2 Peru's sol strengthened a bit, ending at PEN2.879 per U.S. dollar. The sol ended the previous session at PEN2.881 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 So far this year the sol has strengthened by 8.20% against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 In a report Monday \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  said it strongly believes that Peru, in contrast to Colombia, is not likely to impose capital controls.\par \par \uc2 "One important reason is that direct \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market has more of an impact in the Peruvian Sol market than certain other \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets such as that of the Colombian peso," it said.\par \par \uc2 -By Sophie Kevany and Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-198-903-8043; peru@dowjones.com [ 11-23-09 1642ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837 5077   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020091123e5bn000dk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
