\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Stocks End Weaker As Blue Chips Fall; Sol Weakens\b0\par\par\uc2 305 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Oktober 2009\par 22:25\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock market indexes ended lower Tuesday, as a wide range of blue chip shares declined.\par \par \uc2 The Lima Stock Exchange's broad General index ended 1.18% weaker at 15,168.73.\par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index ended 1.29% lower at 24,423.61.\par \par \uc2 The mining subindex fell 1.0%.\par \par \uc2 Shares in financial holding company \uc2 Credicorp Ltd\uc2 . (BAP) lost 1.9% to close at $77.00. Credicorp owns Banco de Credito, Peru's biggest bank.\par \par \uc2 Precious-metals miner \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BUENAVC1.VL) fell 1.2% to close at 105.25 soles ($36.83) as gold prices eased.\par \par \uc2 Base-metals miner \uc2 Southern Copper Corp\uc2 . (PCU) declined 1.1% to end at $34.90 as copper prices weakened.\par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to buy $56 million.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has now \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase dollars for seven consecutive trading sessions, aiming to smooth out volatility in the exchange market.\par \par \uc2 With the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the sol ended slightly weaker Tuesday at PEN2.858 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at PEN2.855 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The sol has appreciated by 8.86% against the U.S. dollar so far this year.\par \par \uc2 A decision by the Central Reserve Bank of Peru to allow private pension funds to invest 22% of their portfolios abroad, up from 20%, won't do much to stem the appreciation of the sol, \uc2 J.P. Morgan\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 "While the BCRP's decision is positive for offshore investment, it is unlikely to check further PEN appreciation amid broad USD weakness," it said.\par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-99927 7269; peru@dowjones.com [ 10-20-09 1625ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837 5077   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020091020e5ak000dp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
